# Cortex-A53 errata 843419 (ADRP at page offset 0xff8/0xffc followed by a
# dependent load may address the next page) and 835769 (multiply-accumulate
# after a load). r0p4 is affected, that is the A64 in the pine64 and the
# little cores of the RK3399. Mitigation only: the linker rewrites ARM's
# documented sequence, the one that crashed libLLVM.so on the pine64 is
# outside it. Via package.env, make.conf is shared with amd64 whose ld
# rejects the options. Reproducer and details in gentoo-build/ISSUES.md
LDFLAGS="${LDFLAGS} -Wl,--fix-cortex-a53-843419 -Wl,--fix-cortex-a53-835769"
